# Architecture (homework + credits)

## Status

- **`GET /v2/homework/session/status`** is the source of truth for step, waiting flags, tutor video fields, and **`credits`**. The BFF mirrors this under `/api/homework/session/status`.

## Credits

- **−5** is charged on **homework completion with report** (backend idempotency), **not** on session start.
- **`POST …/session/start`** returns **402** when balance **&lt; 5**; UI must handle insufficient credits without faking balance client-side.
- **Abandon** does not charge.
- **`credits`** is returned on status for **both** `has_active_session: false` and `has_active_session: true` so balance can show during a session.
- Full contract: **`https://github.com/wilplus/frontend-cursor/blob/36de5b1b244b363d661143a91a1a149fd2f04761/docs/FRONTEND-WHAT-TO-KNOW.md`**
- Backend: **`v2_charge_homework_completion_credits_once`**, **`add_homework_credits_charged_at.sql`**
